                  %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} TC(T^n)=n+1
            for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+complexity"} topological complexity
            of the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/torus"} torus
