          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isomorphisms"} isomorphisms
              in Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#nSphereAsCosetSpace"}
              and Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#OddDimSphereAsSpecialUnitaryCoset"}
              above hold in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+spaces"} topological spaces
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homeomorphisms"}> homeomorphisms
              ), but in fact also in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifolds"} smooth manifolds
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diffeomorphisms"}> diffeomorphisms
              ) and even in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category"} category
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riemannian+manifolds"} Riemannian manifolds
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isometries"}> isometries
              ).
            %p
              The other
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coset+space"} coset space
              realizations of some
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-spheres"} n-spheres
              in Prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TransitiveEffectiveActionsOfConnectedLieGroupsOnSpheres"}
              are
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homeomorphisms"} homeomorphisms
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isometries"} isometries
              (“
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/squashed+spheres"}> squashed spheres
              ”). There is also a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/double+coset+space"} double coset space
              realization which is not even a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diffeomorphisms"} diffeomorphisms
              (“
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exotic+sphere"}> exotic sphere
              ”, the
              = succeed ")." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gromoll-Meyer+sphere"} Gromoll-Meyer sphere
            %p
